    "A channel to each output": {
      "comment": "Shown on the iPhone or iPad. Output screen, in a small table titled “What Reaches the Output” that lists facts read back from iOS while a song plays on an external DAC or audio interface. Value for the row “Surround”: each channel of a surround song goes to its own output of the audio interface, unmixed. Short.",
