    "BIT-PERFECT": {
      "comment": "Shown on the iPhone or iPad. Part of the built-in demo, which shows a pretend Mac. This is what a real Mac would say in its own language: use the Mac app's established translation where one exists (look it up in /mnt/project-files/l10n/final/<lang>.json). The Mac's badge when the output receives the song's samples unchanged. The Mac app has this exact key: use its translation unchanged.",
