    "CUT ON THE MAC": {
      "comment": "Shown on the iPhone or iPad. Small badge in Now Playing for a track of a CUE sheet (one long lossless file holding a whole album): the Mac cut this track out of the file and sent its samples unchanged. It replaces the badge “CONVERTED ON THE MAC”; match how that badge was translated (/mnt/project-files/l10n/ios/out/<lang>.json), with “cut” (as in cutting a piece out) in place of “converted”. Capitals where the script has them. Very short.",
