    "HDMI · 8 channels · 32–192 kHz": {
      "comment": "Shown on the iPhone or iPad. Part of the built-in demo, which shows a pretend Mac. This is what a real Mac would say in its own language: use the Mac app's established translation where one exists (look it up in /mnt/project-files/l10n/final/<lang>.json). One line describing an HDMI receiver in the outputs list. Keep “HDMI”, “kHz”, the “·” separators and the en dash.",
