    "Resampled by iOS": {
      "comment": "Shown on the iPhone or iPad. Output screen, in a small table titled “What Reaches the Output” that lists facts read back from iOS while a song plays on an external DAC or audio interface. Row label: whether iOS is changing the song's sample rate on the way to the output. The value is Yes or No. Match how “resampled by iOS” was translated in “%@ kHz, resampled by iOS” (/mnt/project-files/l10n/ios/out/<lang>.json).",
