    "SURROUND ON %@ OUTPUTS": {
      "comment": "Shown on the iPhone or iPad. Small badge in Now Playing: a surround song plays on an audio interface with each channel on an output of its own. %@ is the number of outputs, e.g. 6. Match the style of the existing badges “SURROUND FOLDED TO STEREO” and “CONVERTED ON THE MAC” (/mnt/project-files/l10n/ios/out/<lang>.json). Capitals where the script has them.",
