            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連線到「%@」的方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Reaches the Output": {
      "comment": "Shown on the iPhone or iPad. Section title on the Output screen, above a small table of facts about the playing song and the sound output (a DAC, headphones, the speaker). Title case where your language uses it.",
